// Chronicle hints: cause_tag of the main cause -> an annalist's remark the chronicle tells as
// a sentence of its own after the entry (sim.rs capitalises it and adds the full stop):
// lowercase, no final punctuation, no numbers, past tense about the founder's deed.
// Every cause_tag of every event and action needs one; data_lint checks it.
// Stage 30: `tag#2`, `tag#3`, … are variants of `tag`, numbered on: a hint told again in
// one chronicle takes the next of them, round and round (sim::vary_hints).
